{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0005-s005", "text": "Också studier främjar integrationen och hjälper personen att hitta ett arbete i framtiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0005-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.41815185546875, "generation_seconds": 26.66350589506328, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0006-s001", "text": "En viktig del av integrationen är att lära känna andra människor som bor i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0006-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.33624267578125, "generation_seconds": 26.869007095927373, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0006-s002", "text": "Sociala nätverk är viktiga för människans välbefinnande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0006-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.296478271484375, "generation_seconds": 21.047763976966962, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0006-s003", "text": "Det kan vara till nytta att lära känna andra människor som flyttat till Finland från andra länder, eftersom de kan ge kamratstöd för integrationen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0006-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.352447509765625, "generation_seconds": 29.82856344198808, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0007-s001", "text": "Integration innebär också att den nyanlända deltar i samhällets verksamhet på sätt som passar hen själv och känner sig delaktig i det finländska samhället.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0007-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.165714285714285, "peak": 0.298736572265625, "generation_seconds": 27.460445292061195, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0007-s002", "text": "Delaktighet innebär att personen kan påverka sitt liv och de saker som är viktiga för hen i hens gemenskap och omgivning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0007-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.3134765625, "generation_seconds": 17.772241245023906, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0007-s003", "text": "Om personen vill kan hen delta i gemensam verksamhet och gemensamt beslutsfattande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0007-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.367156982421875, "generation_seconds": 10.725686294957995, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0008-s001", "text": "Till integrationen hör att den nyanlända har kännedom om det finländska samhället och den finländska kulturen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063340710753+0000-3/hb-c12-u0008-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.262908935546875, "generation_seconds": 20.58949639997445, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
